Expanded Markdown
=================

Soft line
continues as prose, while two trailing spaces  
create a hard break and a trailing backslash\
does the same.

- [x] Setext headings
- [ ] Task lists
- [x] Strikethrough with ~~removed text~~

Autolinks include <https://example.com/docs> and https://openai.com.

Escaped \*stars\* remain literal.

Footnote references work from markdown syntax[^note].

[^note]: Footnote definitions may include *inline emphasis*.
